#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0364 expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
# Rule:Description: DOSEON or DOSCUMA is present and DOSEU is not present
#note "DOSEON present but DOSEU also present -> second conjunct false -> noViolation"
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ASEQ type=Num
col DOSEON type=Num
col DOSEU type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | 50 | mg
---
